msgstr "When you enter a Space, a character picker appears first: choose from the classic Hero or one of seven classes — Sorceress, Knight, Archer, Barbarian, Rogue, Cleric or Monk. Each shows an animated preview and has its own walking and attack animations; click one to enter the map wearing it, and everyone in the space sees your choice. The picker shows again each time you re-enter, defaulting to your last pick."

